{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuum Keeper</strong> is a psychological horror puzzle game where you monitor surveillance cameras across unstable realities and report <strong>Fractures</strong>\u2014distortions in time, space, and logic that threaten to collapse the multiverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>Continuum Keeper</strong>, your job is to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch multiple live camera feeds</strong> across locations like a gas station and a luxury subway train and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spot Fractures</strong>\u2014such as shifting objects, missing items, mysterious figures, or impossible changes in the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Report the correct location</strong> where a Fracture is occurring to prevent destabilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive your shift</strong> and maintain the stability of reality.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Paranoia:</strong> No two playthroughs are exactly the same. Fractures appear in different ways each time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Environments:</strong> Monitor cameras in a gas station and a luxury subway train, with more locations planned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Story Unfolding:</strong> Discover the origins of the Fractures and your role in protecting the timelines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> Experience surreal distortions, unsettling imagery, and creeping existential dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge and Replayability:</strong> Every shift tests your attention to detail and ability to adapt under pressure.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail to catch too many Fractures, and reality collapses\u2014ending 